# Defense in depth. The host runner already builds a curated context:
# CLI src/tsconfig/scripts/cli shim/package files/docs + test/bridge.
**/.git
**/.git/**
**/node_modules
**/node_modules/**
**/.state
**/.state/**
**/.artifacts
**/.artifacts/**
**/artifacts
**/artifacts/**
**/.cc-connect
**/.cc-connect/**
**/.compile-*
**/bili_credential.json
**/credential.json
**/credentials.json
**/cookies*
**/cookie*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/.netrc
**/.git-credentials
**/audit.jsonl
**/qrcode_login.png
**/*.tgz
**/*.log

# Never ship generated build outputs or stale test state even if a future
# allowlist accidentally includes them.
packages/bilibili-cli/dist
packages/bilibili-cli/test/bridge/.artifacts
packages/bilibili-cli/release
